Upgrading
*********


Upgrading to Version 2.4
========================

- the methods `setDocuments()`, `getDocuments()`, and `addDocument()` were replaced by `setComment()`, `getComment()`, and `addComment()`

{{maintitle: Upgrading Nette PhpGenerator: What Changed in Version 2.4}}
{{description: What changed in Nette PhpGenerator 2.4: methods for working with documents were replaced by setComment(), getComment() and addComment().}}
